`num_long_term_pics + num_long_term_sps + num_neg_pics + num_pos_pics <= MAX_DPB_SIZE - 1 = 15`

But `u4_num_total_curr` counts only the "used by current pic" entries, not all entries. So `u4_num_total_curr` could be less than the total. But `i1_num_ref_idx_l0_active` can be up to `MAX_DPB_SIZE - 1 = 15`.

So `u4_num_rps_curr_temp_list0` can be up to 15, and `as_ref_pic_list_temp0` has 16 elements. That should be fine.

